{
  "name": "Find companies hiring for sales (or any team) every week and log them as leads in Google Sheets",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Find companies hiring for sales (or any team) every week and log them as leads in Google Sheets\n\nA company that opens several sales roles in a week is growing its sales team, a buying signal for sales tools, recruiters and agencies. Every Monday this workflow asks the Apify *Hiring Signals API* for companies with at least N new jobs in a function over the past 7 days, using data from 17,000+ company career sites, and appends one row per company to Google Sheets.\n\n**Who it's for:** SDRs and founders building outbound lists, recruiting agencies, investors tracking hiring momentum.\n\n### How it works\n1. **Schedule Trigger** runs every Monday at 8:00.\n2. **Set your lead criteria** holds the job function, locations and thresholds you edit.\n3. **HTTP Request** calls `cleanrowdata/hiring-signals-api` with `onlyNewSinceLastRun`, so each week brings only companies you have not seen before.\n4. **Keep sheet columns** builds one lead row (company, careers page, signal strength, new-job count, sample job links) and **Google Sheets** appends it.\n\n### Setup\n1. Create a free [Apify](https://apify.com) account and copy your API token (Settings > API & Integrations).\n2. In the HTTP Request node create a **Header Auth** credential: Name `Authorization`, Value `Bearer YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN`.\n3. Edit **Set your lead criteria**. Functions: sales, security, ai_ml, data, customer_success, engineering, product, design, marketing, finance, people_hr, legal, healthcare, operations.\n4. Create a Google Sheet with headers `company, careers_url, ats, signal_strength, new_jobs, top_function, latest_new_job_at, sample_job_titles, sample_job_links`, connect Google Sheets and select it.\n\n### Requirements\nApify account (pay per company row: $5 per 1,000; the free plan includes $5/month of credit), Google Sheets.\n\n### Customization\nSend rows to HubSpot or Clay, or enrich each company with an email-finder node.",
        "height": 880,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 1
      },
